  description: A knight of the Kingdom of Grandshelt, Rain was an affable airship
    captain whose newest adventure stirred the feelings he had always concealed about
    his absent father, Sir Raegen.
  summonDesc: I will always lend a hand to those who need me. It's my duty, as a
    knight of Grandshelt!
  fusionDesc: This energy... Where is it coming from? It all feels so familiar...
  evoDesc: Fighting your own battles helps you grow. I'm sure Lasswell would agree.
